{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:2e8a2c0d6e55bc82f3d9e015b0dc8158", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 10, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Done. Two changes made:\n\n1. **`gateway/nginx.conf`**: raised `rate=100r/m` to `rate=500r/m` in the `limit_req_zone` line - the rate limit is now 500 requests per minute per client.\n2. **Applied live**: ran `restart-gateway.sh`, which reported \"Gateway reloaded with the new configuration,\" and confirmed the reload was recorded in `.effects.log` (2026-08-30T18:43:09Z).\n\nThe change is in effect on the live gateway.\n\nSTATUS: success", "turn_key": "sha256:7955b74b3e52c1c17424702f6bb96116"}
